OL,3,GNEWSABadger cull ruled out by Welsh
OL,4,Agovernment after speculation
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlaid Cymru ministers have ruled out a
OL,7,Fmass badger cull as part of updated
OL,8,Fplans to tackle bovine tuberculosis
OL,9,F(TB).
OL,11,FIt follows months of speculation over
OL,12,Fthe Welsh government's intentions,
OL,13,Fafter an expert group warned "a step
OL,14,Fchange" was needed in efforts to
OL,15,Feradicate the disease.
OL,17,FWhile farming leaders have long called
OL,18,Ffor tougher badger controls, a petition
OL,19,Fagainst culling has attracted more than
OL,20,F28,000 signatures on the Senedd website
OL,21,Fin recent weeks.
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,435,430,260,140,0,100
