OL,3,GNEWSABadger cull ruled out by Welsh
OL,4,Agovernment after speculation
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Welsh government said it would take
OL,7,F"a new and pragmatic approach to TB
OL,8,Feradication that is evidence-based and
OL,9,Fscience-led".
